h a partner. Across cities, I learned how much guest selection and seating mattered to making a small group of founders connect.",{"children":"A reverse-prompting activity gave everyone a card to explore with their AI agent of choice, then a response to discuss with a partner. Across cities, I learned how much guest selection and seating mattered to making a small group of founders connect."}]]]}],"$L9","$La"]}]]}],"$Lb","$Lc"]}]]}]
9:["$","section","What we learned",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What we learned"}],[["$","p","Conversations surfaced interest in stronger connections to the stablecoin ecosystem and the endpoints builders wanted from a provider like Zerion. The transaction endpoint emerged as particularly important. The dinner gave us a more specific understanding of what clients needed.",{"children":"Conversations surfaced interest in stronger connections to the stablecoin ecosystem and the endpoints builders wanted from a provider like Zerion. The transaction endpoint emerged as particularly important. The dinner gave us a more specific understanding of what clients needed."}]]]}]
a:["$","section","How we followed through",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How we followed through"}],[["$","p","I gathered client feedback, sent personalized Luma messages, and coordinated priority contacts with our Enterprise and GTM team. Together, we reviewed the next client conversations and which relationships could benefit from another event.",{"children":"I gathered client feedback, sent personalized Luma messages, and coordinated priority contacts with our Enterprise and GTM team. Together, we reviewed the next client conversations and which relationships could benefit from another event."}]]]}]
